title: Suspicious redirect chain
severity: medium
score: 25
tags: suspicious-redirect, cloaking
attack: T1608.005
description: Three or more cross-site redirects, a long chain through several sites, or an
  https to http downgrade.
---
// Three or more cross-site hops, an https: to http: hop, or a long chain (5 or more hops)
// with at least two cross-site ones.
capture
| extend hops = toscalar(redirects | count), cross_site = toscalar(cross_site_hops | count)
| where cross_site >= 3 or exists(https_downgrades) or (hops >= 5 and cross_site >= 2)
| project hops, cross_site, downgrade = exists(https_downgrades)
